"A Keep Awake session now survives Helm restarting. A two-hour session lived only in memory, so anything that ended the app — a silent update most often — cancelled it: the countdown vanished from the menu bar, the Mac was free to sleep, and nothing said so. It comes back with the time it had left. A session whose end passed while Helm was gone stays finished." = "防止睡眠的会话现在能在 Helm 重启后继续。两小时的会话只存在于内存中，因此任何结束应用的操作 —— 通常是静默更新 —— 都会取消它：菜单栏的倒计时消失，Mac 可以入睡，而且没有任何提示。现在它会带着剩余时间回来。若结束时间在 Helm 不在期间已过，会话保持结束状态。";
"A VPN carries everything this Mac sends, not only that app, and it takes a few seconds to come up after the app starts." = "VPN 承载这台 Mac 的全部流量，不只是该应用的，而且隧道要在应用启动几秒后才建立。";
"A design pass over the whole app, in the macOS 26/27 idiom: Liquid Glass on the menu-bar panel, page titles that line up with the page beneath them at any window width, text that recedes without becoming unreadable, and numbers that roll instead of cutting. The sidebar groups modules into Files and Utilities rather than putting five of seven in one pile, and the window opens wide enough for the Disk screen to show everything it measures." = "对整个应用做了一次符合 macOS 26/27 风格的设计调整：菜单栏面板采用 Liquid Glass，页面标题在任何窗口宽度下都与下方内容对齐，次要文字在变淡的同时保持可读，数字滚动而不是硬切。侧边栏按“文件”和“实用工具”分组。";
"A few things fixed that you’re unlikely to ever notice directly: a symbolic link inside a folder Helm may clean could send removal to a different file than the one it confirmed; the diagnostics log’s short tags for app, VPN and package names could be reversed back into the real names by anyone holding the same public lists Helm draws them from; and Homebrew’s one-time setup step now names its two admin commands outright rather than trusting the environment to find them." = "还有一些你大概不会直接察觉的修复：Helm 允许清理的文件夹里如果藏着符号链接，删除动作可能会作用到与确认屏幕不同的文件上；诊断日志里为应用、VPN 和软件包名称生成的短标签，只要拥有 Helm 用来生成它们的同一份公开列表，就能被反推出真实名称；Homebrew 的一次性安装步骤现在会直接写明它用到的两条管理员命令，而不是依赖环境去找到它们。";
"A filter hides the kinds you are not reviewing — system extensions, for instance." = "筛选器可隐藏你当前不查看的类型，例如系统扩展。";
"A layout that names no country keeps its letters, in a frame the same size as a flag." = "没有国家归属的布局保持字母显示，边框与旗帜同样大小。";
"A new look across the app: every screen leads with its icon and the numbers that matter there, on one consistent layout." = "全新界面：每个页面以图标和关键数字开场，版式统一。";
"A rule is a decision made once and carried out from then on, so it is shown before it is switched on." = "规则是一次做出、此后一直执行的决定，所以在开启之前先展示它。";
"A short token you type often, and what it stands for. It expands when you finish the word." = "你经常输入的简写，以及它代表的内容。在词输入完成时展开。";
"A way out of a scan in Disk. The module opens on whatever it measured last, and the only button was “Scan again”, which measures the same place — so a scan of the wrong folder came back at every launch with no way to leave it. “Choose another…” beside it clears the screen and forgets the saved scan." = "“磁盘”中终于有了退出扫描的办法：“选择其他…”会清空界面并忘记已保存的扫描。";
"A word is checked when you finish it this way. Moving the caret or clicking elsewhere never converts — by then you have moved on." = "以这些方式结束单词时才会判断。移动光标或点击别处从不转换——那时你已经离开了。";
"A word is only changed when it is not a word as typed and is one once swapped. Anything valid is left alone." = "只有当按原样不是单词、转换后才是单词时才替换。有效的内容不会被改动。";
