"Disk Space suggests what to free: bloated caches, old downloads and big files untouched for months — one tap adds them to the basket. The scan result now survives switching modules and is kept for a day." = "磁盘空间会建议可释放的内容：膨胀的缓存、旧下载和数月未动的大文件——点一下即可加入收集篮。扫描结果在切换模块后保留，有效期一天。";
