"Duplicates can basket every extra at once, and Space shows you a file before you bin it. “All extras to basket” does across every group what the per-group button did — one copy of everything always stays, which is why it is not called “Select all”. Beside “Move to Trash” there is now a “Clear”, so one press can undo one press." = "“重复文件”可以一次把所有多余的副本放入收集篮，按空格键可在删除前预览文件。每组始终保留一份，所以按钮不叫“全选”。“移到废纸篓”旁边新增了“清空”。";
