"One key does both fixes. Pick right ⌘, ⌥, ⌃ or ⇧ and press it on its own: the first tap fixes the last word, the next puts it back. It keeps working as a modifier — held down, or pressed with anything else, it is an ordinary key again, so nothing you already use it for stops working." = "一个键完成两件事：选择右侧 ⌘、⌥、⌃ 或 ⇧ 并单独按下，第一次修正上一个词，再按一次还原。按住或与其他键同时按下时，它仍是普通修饰键。";
