"m" = "分钟";
"macOS asks for an administrator password the first time Keep Awake runs with this on. If Helm is quit while sleep is off, it stays off until Helm runs again." = "启用后“保持唤醒”首次运行时，macOS 会要求输入管理员密码。若在睡眠关闭时退出 Helm，它会一直保持关闭，直到 Helm 再次启动。";
"macOS is not allowing notifications from Helm. The name will be shown in the menu bar instead." = "macOS 不允许 Helm 发送通知。将改为在菜单栏显示名称。";
"macOS may already use 🌐︎ to switch input source, open emoji or start dictation. Set “Press 🌐︎ to: Do Nothing” in Keyboard settings, or it will do both. Keyboards without a 🌐︎ key never send it." = "macOS 可能已把 🌐︎ 用于切换输入法、打开表情或听写。请在键盘设置中选择“按下 🌐︎ 键时：不执行任何操作”，否则两件事都会发生。没有 🌐︎ 键的键盘不会发送它。";
"macOS would not move this. Show it in the Finder and try from there — the Finder says more about why." = "macOS 未能移动它。请在访达中显示并从那里尝试——访达会给出更详细的原因。";
"min" = "分钟";
"moved to" = "移动到";
"moved to Trash" = "移到废纸篓";
"newer than" = "晚于";
"older than" = "早于";
"refused" = "已拒绝";
"renamed to" = "重命名为";
"smaller than" = "小于";
"stays" = "保留";
"tagged" = "标签";
"{name}, {date} and {counter} are replaced. The extension is always the file’s own." = "{name}、{date} 和 {counter} 会被替换。扩展名始终保持文件本身的。";
"ПРивет → Привет. Never ПРИВЕТ — that is shouting on purpose — and never a word with a digit in it." = "ПРивет → Привет。绝不改 ПРИВЕТ——那是刻意的强调；含数字的词也不改。";
"🌐︎" = "🌐︎";

