"Remove section" = "删除分组";
"Use the default name" = "使用默认名称";
"Drag to reorder. A module can go into any section, and a section you remove hands its modules to its neighbour." = "拖动可重新排序。模块可放入任意分组；删除分组后，其中的模块会移交给相邻分组。";
"Drag a module here" = "将模块拖到此处";
"your section" = "自定分区";
