"Behaviour, appearance, permissions and what Helm may remove." = "行为、外观、权限，以及 Helm 可以删除什么。";
"Order and sections" = "顺序与分组";
"A switch turns the module off everywhere in Helm." = "开关会在整个 Helm 中停用该模块。";
"Remove widget" = "移除小组件";
"Widget size" = "小组件尺寸";
"Add widget" = "添加小组件";
"Module is off" = "模块已关闭";
"Main" = "主要";
"New tab" = "新建标签页";
"Close tab" = "关闭标签页";
"Tab" = "标签页";
"Edit widgets" = "编辑小组件";
"Show the edit button in the panel" = "在面板中显示编辑按钮";
"Choose what is in the list" = "选择列表中的项目";
"Author" = "作者";
"Tab labels" = "标签页样式";
"Text" = "文字";
"Glyph and text" = "图形与文字";
"Glyph" = "图形";
"Icon" = "图标";
"Work" = "工作";
"Nature" = "自然";
"Category" = "类别";
"All three are also in the menu-bar icon’s right-click menu." = "这三项也都在菜单栏图标的右键菜单里。";
"Edit panel" = "编辑面板";
"Editing the panel" = "正在编辑面板";
"Nothing on this tab yet" = "此标签页还是空的";
"Press the pencil below to add a widget." = "点按下方的铅笔即可添加小组件。";
"Right-click the menu-bar icon to add a widget." = "右键点按菜单栏图标即可添加小组件。";
"Widgets are moved by hand. Pick one up and it follows the pointer; the others slide aside; letting go sets it down where the space opened." = "小组件可以直接用手挪动：拿起一个，它会跟着指针走，其他小组件让开，松手后它落在空出的位置。";
"About Helm says who wrote it, with a way to reach him." = "“关于 Helm”写明了作者，并提供联系方式。";
"The panel is arranged in the panel. “Edit panel” in its footer: give a widget one of three sizes, take one off, add one from the gallery, make a tab. Keep Awake, VPN, Autopilot, Disk and Keyboard come in more than one size, and Disk shows how much of the disk is still free." = "面板就在面板里编排。底部的“编辑面板”：给小组件选三种尺寸之一、移除、从图库添加、新建标签页。“保持唤醒”、VPN、“自动整理”、“磁盘”和“键盘”支持不止一种尺寸，“磁盘”还会显示磁盘还剩多少可用空间。";
"Light, dark or automatic is three pictures now, not a menu of three words — the way macOS asks the same question." = "浅色、深色或自动现在是三张图片，而不是三个词的菜单 — 与 macOS 提出同一问题的方式一致。";
"Settings says what is missing before you scroll: a line at the top counts the permissions macOS is withholding and the modules they reach." = "设置在你滚动之前就说明缺少什么：顶部一行统计 macOS 未授予的权限以及受影响的模块。";
"One arrangement for everything. The order and sections you compose now decide the panel as well, not just the window’s sidebar." = "一套排列。你编排的顺序与分组现在也决定面板，而不只是窗口边栏。";
"The menu-bar icon has six shapes and three sizes — S, M and L. The shape menu draws each one at the size you chose, so what you see is what the bar gets." = "菜单栏图标有六种形状和三种尺寸（S、M、L）。形状菜单按所选尺寸绘制，所见即菜单栏所得。";
"The warning in the sidebar now marks only a module that can do nothing without a permission. It marked seven of nine, including one that was working perfectly well." = "边栏的警告只标记没有权限就无法工作的模块。此前九个中有七个被标记，其中一个其实运行良好。";
"Pressing “Move to Trash” twice no longer says the first removal failed. The files had already gone; asking again brought back a refusal for every one of them, printed over the list of what had actually moved — and in Disk the folders that had left were still drawn on the ring." = "再次点击“移到废纸篓”不再报告第一次删除失败：文件已经移走，第二次会为每个文件返回一次拒绝。而在“磁盘”里，已经移走的文件夹仍画在环上。";
"The Uninstaller now counts a file removed with the folder it was in. The file did go to the Trash — it was only missing from the report, so a removal of four things said three." = "卸载器现在会计入随上层文件夹一起删除的文件。该文件确实已进入废纸篓，只是没有写进报告，删除四项时只报告三项。";
"The Uninstaller no longer overstates how much a removal moved to the Trash: two names for one file were counted as two files." = "卸载器不再夸大删除释放的空间：同一个文件的两个名字此前按两个文件计算。";
"Removing an app that is still running waits for it to quit. Helm waited a fixed moment and moved the bundle anyway, so a slow app carried on from where it had been moved and wrote its settings back on the way out — putting back the leftovers that had just been taken." = "删除仍在运行的应用会等待它退出。此前只等固定的一小段时间就移动程序包，应用退出时又把设置写了回来，把刚清理掉的残留又放了回去。";
"A switch no longer shows “off” for a module that is already running." = "开关不再对已经在运行的模块显示“关闭”。";
"The Homebrew console keeps the last thousand lines instead of every line it has ever printed." = "Homebrew 控制台保留最近一千行，而不是曾经打印的全部内容。";
"Clearing Caches works now. macOS protects that folder itself but not what is inside it, so the recommendation could never be carried out. The contents are cleared and the folder stays — one row and one press, as before. Whatever a running app is holding on to stays with it, listed by name, and the row shrinks to what is left." = "现在可以清理 Caches 了。macOS 保护这个文件夹本身，却不保护里面的内容，所以这条建议从来无法执行。现在清理的是内容，文件夹保留 — 仍是一行、一次点击。正在运行的 App 占用的部分会留下并逐项列出，该行也会缩减为剩下的部分。";
"“Show in Finder” opens the folder a file was in when the file itself is gone, and brings Finder forward. It sits beside a file that would not move, beside something Autopilot moved, beside a leftover deleted a moment ago — where a path is most likely to have gone. In all but one of those places, pressing it did nothing, because Finder cannot select a file that is not there." = "“在访达中显示”现在会在文件本身已不存在时打开它原来所在的文件夹，并把访达切到前台。这个按钮就在无法移动的文件旁、在自动整理刚移走的东西旁、在刚删除的残留旁 — 正是路径最可能已经不在的时候 — 而除了一处之外，按下去毫无反应：访达无法选中已经不存在的文件。";
"The sidebar is yours to arrange. Settings → Settings → Sidebar: press Edit and drag a module anywhere — including into a section you made and named yourself. Delete a section and its modules go to the neighbour, never into nothing; “Restore defaults” puts back the arrangement Helm arrived with. The window and the menu-bar icon show the same arrangement, and it survives a restart and an update." = "侧边栏由你排列。设置 → 设置 → 侧边栏：点“编辑”，把模块拖到任何地方，包括你自己新建并命名的分组。删除分组时，其中的模块会移到相邻分组；“恢复默认”可以还原。窗口和菜单栏图标的菜单显示同一种排列，重启和更新后依然保留。";
"Small tidying in Settings. Rows in the Uninstaller are all one height — the “System” mark is a tag beside the name instead of a third line. Login Items no longer says the same thing in two stacked bars. And every size, count and version in the app is in the one typeface Helm keeps for figures." = "设置里的小整理。“卸载器”的每一行现在等高：“系统”标记成了名称旁的标签，而不是第三行。“登录项”不再用上下两条相同的横栏说同一件事。应用里所有的大小、计数和版本号，都用 Helm 专为数字保留的那一种字体。";
"Drag an app to the Trash and Helm offers to clear up after it, a second later — once you switch it on under Uninstaller → Leftovers. The app stays where you put it — Helm lists the settings, caches and support files it left behind, already ticked, and anything matched only by the app’s name arrives unticked. Say no and it does not ask about that app again." = "把 App 移到废纸篓，Helm 会立刻提出替你清理——需先在“卸载”→“残留”里打开。App 留在原处；它留下的设置、缓存和支持文件会列出来并默认勾选，仅靠名称匹配到的则不勾选。你说不，它就不会再问这个 App。";
"The welcome tour lets you pick what you want. Each module’s screen now carries a switch, so you can keep or drop it while you are being introduced to it — and the opening screen asks whether Helm should start with your Mac. The switch starts where the module already stood, so skipping the tour changes nothing." = "欢迎引导现在让你挑选。每个模块的页面都有开关，第一屏会问你是否跟随 Mac 启动 Helm。开关的初始位置就是模块原有的状态，所以跳过不会改变任何东西。";
"Helm no longer asks for permissions the moment you install it. It used to request Full Disk Access and Accessibility on the very first launch, before you had asked it to do anything. Each module now asks for what it needs on its own page, when it needs it — and the old notice still appears if a permission you had granted goes away." = "Helm 不再在安装后立即索要权限。以前它会在首次启动时就请求完全磁盘访问和辅助功能权限。现在每个模块在自己的页面上按需索要。而如果你已授予的权限消失了，原来的提示依然会出现。";
"Hardware" = "硬件";
"Show all" = "全部显示";
"Rostislav Strelnikov" = "Rostislav Strelnikov";
"·" = "·";
"The update channel is two pills, each in its own colour — Beta in the accent, Dev in orange — so which one you follow is visible at a glance. The badge beside the wordmark agrees with them." = "更新通道现在是两个胶囊按钮，各有自己的颜色 — Beta 用强调色，Dev 用橙色，一眼就能看出你在哪个通道。名称旁边的标记也改成了同样的颜色。";
"Helm no longer describes itself as a menu-bar app. It is also a panel, a settings window and a sidebar you arrange yourself, and the line under the name says so." = "Helm 不再把自己说成菜单栏应用。它也是面板、设置窗口，以及你自己编排的边栏，名称下面的那行现在就是这么说的。";
"The line Helm shows when an update check fails is readable in every language. It was cut short in five of the eight, and a German reader saw the first half of it and nothing else." = "检查更新失败时显示的那行字，在所有语言里都能完整读到。八种语言里有五种会被截断，德语只能看到前半句。";
"Helm could crash while you were typing. The part that watches the keyboard went on running after the module had let it go." = "在您打字时，Helm 可能会崩溃。监视键盘的部分在模块放开它之后仍继续运行。";
"Keyboard could stop converting words without saying so. macOS switches the keyboard watcher off by itself when it judges an app too slow to answer; Helm now notices and turns it back on." = "“键盘”可能不再转换单词，却什么也不说。当 macOS 认为某个应用响应过慢时，会自行关闭键盘监视；现在 Helm 会察觉并重新开启。";
"Keep Awake could leave the Mac unable to sleep, with its own switch saying it was off." = "“保持唤醒”可能让 Mac 无法睡眠，而它自己的开关却显示已关闭。";
"The Duplicates page fits the window. Its toolbar was wider than the space it had — at the size the window opens at, and in seven of the eight languages — so the folder path ran under the sidebar and the buttons were cut off at the right edge. It now gives up the count first and then the words on two buttons, keeping every button and the path itself." = "“重复文件”页面能放进窗口了。它的工具栏比可用的空间更宽——在窗口打开时的大小下，八种语言中有七种如此——所以文件夹路径被压到了边栏下面，按钮在右边被切掉。现在它会先舍弃统计，再舍弃两个按钮上的文字，而按钮本身和路径都保留。";
